{"4765930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BallHole", "steam_appid": 4765930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BallHole is half-way between a physics toy and a meditation tool. Frantically smash the button to drop balls and try to hit score-boosting combos! Or turn on &quot;auto-drop&quot; mode and relax to the gentle sounds of balls bouncing while numbers go brrrrrrrrr.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Button Masher:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One button. Mash it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meditation toy</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on automatic mode and let the game run in the background or on a second monitor for a rhythmic relaxation experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rouge-lite</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each round use tickets to purchase a passive perk or raise your chance to spawn special balls. Earn coins every five rounds that you can use to unlock permanent upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Levels:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete each level to unlock the next one with increasing difficulty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Balls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete achievements to unlock powerful special balls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BallHole is half-way between a physics toy and a meditation tool. Frantically smash the button to drop balls and try to hit score-boosting combos! Or turn on &quot;auto-drop&quot; mode and relax to the gentle sounds of balls bouncing while numbers go brrrrrrrrr.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Button Masher:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One button. Mash it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meditation toy</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on automatic mode and let the game run in the background or on a second monitor for a rhythmic relaxation experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rouge-lite</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each round use tickets to purchase a passive perk or raise your chance to spawn special balls. Earn coins every five rounds that you can use to unlock permanent upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Levels:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete each level to unlock the next one with increasing difficulty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Balls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete achievements to unlock powerful special balls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "BallHole is somewhere between a physics toy and a meditation tool. Frantically smash the button to drop balls and try to hit score boosting combos! Or turn on &quot;auto drop&quot; mode and relax to the gentle sounds of balls bouncing while numbers go brrrrrrrrr.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765930/7054d2210ea09409dfd008ad2dabf06dc2e8608c/header.jpg?t=1786743060", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765930/885fab2128d624ce155a7cb6ca753b7f2aa9e00c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786743060", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4765930/885fab2128d624ce155a7cb6ca753b7f2aa9e00c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786743060", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><